     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>total price = purchase price × (1 + tax rate)</p>\n<p>522.01 = purchase price × (1 + 0.0675)</p>\n<p>522.01 = purchase price × (1.0675)</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"\\frac{{522.01}}{{1.0675}}\"></span> = purchase price</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered unstyled\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>$489.00 ≈ purchase price</td>\n<td>(rounded to the nearest cent)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
